01:01:09.930 --> 01:01:11.520
so it's symmetric around 0.

01:01:11.520 --> 01:01:14.520
This is X2, which is
again symmetric around 0.

01:01:14.520 --> 01:01:17.190
So this is how your
tuples might look like.

01:01:17.190 --> 01:01:19.710
So for example, your one
