I want origin.

01:05:54.920 --> 01:05:56.840
I love origin.

01:05:56.840 --> 01:06:00.050
So I picked one of
my codewords here.

01:06:00.050 --> 01:06:05.060
OK, in that case, again, going
by the spherical symmetry,

01:06:05.060 --> 01:06:09.170
my other three codewords will
