01:06:22.850 --> 01:06:25.500
between any of these two points.

01:06:25.500 --> 01:06:26.960
So it should pass
through origin.

01:06:30.770 --> 01:06:33.050
So these are just the
separating hyper planes

01:06:33.050 --> 01:06:36.440
between any of these points.

01:06:36.440 --> 01:06:41.580
And so your decision boundaries
would just be this, right?

01:06:48.480 --> 01:06:50.520
These would be your
decision boundaries.

01:06:50.520 --> 01:06:52.830
What this means is if
you get a point X1,

01:06:52.830 --> 01:06:55.277
X2 here, you would map it
to this particular guy.

01:06:55.277 --> 01:06:57.360
If you get it here, map
it to this particular guy.

01:06:57.360 --> 01:06:58.152
So on and so forth.

01:07:00.800 --> 01:07:02.840
And actually, in this
case, it's interesting

01:07:02.840 --> 01:07:08.120
that you can show that
