01:21:00.340 --> 01:21:04.600
And as you keep
running this, you

01:21:04.600 --> 01:21:07.677
get something which is
spherically symmetrical.

01:21:07.677 --> 01:21:09.760
It converges to something
spherically symmetrical.

01:21:09.760 --> 01:21:12.220
So these four are your
quantization points.

01:21:12.220 --> 01:21:13.930
And different colors
are the regions.

01:21:13.930 --> 01:21:16.570
Similarly, you can do so with
more number of codewords.

01:21:16.570 --> 01:21:19.710
You could have
given more weight.

01:21:19.710 --> 01:21:21.570
And now you start with
something like this.

01:21:21.570 --> 01:21:23.445
Oh, by the way, this is
spherically symmetric

01:21:23.445 --> 01:21:25.740
like we discussed earlier,
so it seems right.

01:21:25.740 --> 01:21:29.040
And so if you had eight
different codewords,

01:21:29.040 --> 01:21:30.995
you keep doing this.

01:21:30.995 --> 01:21:32.370
Now it looks
something different.

01:21:32.370 --> 01:21:34.740
Now it looks something
