01:21:36.480 --> 01:21:39.690
So you can see, like, k-means,
by the way, is not unique.

01:21:39.690 --> 01:21:44.310
It depends on the initial points
you start working on it with.

01:21:44.310 --> 01:21:47.250
And finally, what you
